{{define "actions_list.tmpl"}}
AVAILABLE ACTIONS:

MOVEMENT (consume action tick):
- "undock" - Leave the current station (no target)
- "dock" - Dock at the current POI (no target)
- "travel" - Travel to a POI in the current system (requires target: POI ID)
- "jump" - Jump to another system (requires target: system name)

COMBAT & STEALTH (consume action tick):
- "attack" - Attack a target (requires target: player/NPC ID)
- "scan" - Scan the current area (no target)
- "cloak" - Activate/deactivate cloaking (no target)

MINING & SALVAGE (consume action tick):
- "mine" - Mine resources at current location (no target)
- "loot_wreck" - Loot items from a wreck (requires target: wreck ID)
- "salvage_wreck" - Salvage a wreck for materials (requires target: wreck ID)
- "loot_base_wreck" - Loot items from a base wreck (requires target: wreck ID)
- "salvage_base_wreck" - Salvage a base wreck (requires target: wreck ID)

TRADING & MARKET (consume action tick):
- "buy" - Buy items from station (requires target: item ID, parameters: quantity)
- "sell" - Sell items at station (requires target: item ID, parameters: quantity)
- "list_item" - List item for sale (requires target: item ID, parameters: price, quantity)
- "cancel_list" - Cancel a listing (requires target: listing ID)
- "buy_listing" - Buy from player listing (requires target: listing ID)
- "trade_offer" - Offer trade to player (requires target: player ID)
- "trade_accept" - Accept trade offer (requires target: trade ID)
- "trade_decline" - Decline trade offer (requires target: trade ID)
- "trade_cancel" - Cancel trade offer (requires target: trade ID)

SHIP MANAGEMENT (consume action tick):
- "buy_ship" - Purchase a new ship (requires target: ship type)
- "install_mod" - Install module on ship (requires target: item ID)
- "uninstall_mod" - Remove module from ship (requires target: module slot)
- "refuel" - Refuel at station (no target)
- "repair" - Repair ship at station (no target)
- "buy_insurance" - Purchase ship insurance (no target)
- "claim_insurance" - Claim insurance after destruction (no target)
- "set_colors" - Set ship color scheme (parameters: colors)
- "set_anonymous" - Toggle anonymous mode (parameters: true/false)

CRAFTING (consume action tick):
- "craft" - Craft items from recipes (requires target: recipe ID)

FACTION (consume action tick):
- "create_faction" - Create a new faction (parameters: name, description)
- "join_faction" - Join a faction (requires target: faction ID)
- "leave_faction" - Leave current faction (no target)
- "faction_invite" - Invite player to faction (requires target: player ID)
- "faction_kick" - Remove player from faction (requires target: player ID)
- "faction_promote" - Promote faction member (requires target: player ID)

BASE OPERATIONS (consume action tick):
- "build_base" - Construct a base (parameters: base type)
- "attack_base" - Attack a player base (requires target: base ID)
- "set_home_base" - Set current station as home (no target)

MAP & NOTES (consume action tick):
- "create_map" - Create exploration map (no target)
- "use_map" - Use a map item (requires target: map ID)
- "create_note" - Create a note (parameters: content)
- "write_note" - Write to existing note (requires target: note ID, parameters: content)

COMMUNICATION (consume action tick):
- "chat" - Send chat message (parameters: channel, message)
- "set_status" - Set player status message (parameters: status text)
- "forum_create_thread" - Create forum thread (parameters: title, content)
- "forum_reply" - Reply to forum thread (requires target: thread ID, parameters: content)
- "forum_upvote" - Upvote forum post (requires target: post ID)
- "forum_delete_thread" - Delete forum thread (requires target: thread ID)
- "forum_delete_reply" - Delete forum reply (requires target: reply ID)

QUERY COMMANDS (do NOT consume action tick):
Player & Ship Info:
- "get_status" - Get player status (no target)
- "get_ship" - Get ship details (no target)
- "get_skills" - Get skill information (no target)

World Info:
- "get_system" - Get current system info (no target)
- "get_poi" - Get POI details (requires target: POI ID)
- "get_base" - Get base information (requires target: base ID)
- "get_map" - Get map data (no target)
- "get_version" - Get server version (no target)
- "get_base_cost" - Get base construction costs (no target)

Market & Trading:
- "get_listings" - Get market listings (no target)
- "get_trades" - Get active trades (no target)
- "get_wrecks" - Get nearby wrecks (no target)
- "get_base_wrecks" - Get wrecks at base (no target)
- "get_recipes" - Get crafting recipes (no target)
- "get_notes" - Get player notes (no target)

Raid Info:
- "raid_status" - Get raid status (no target)

Forum:
- "forum_list" - List forum threads (no target)
- "forum_get_thread" - Get thread details (requires target: thread ID)

Other:
- "help" - Get help information (no target)
- "wait" - Wait and do nothing (no target)
{{end}}